WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,840
They're infected, it's pitiful

2
00:00:01,840 --> 00:00:03,840
The people bitten by them are also pitiful

3
00:00:03,840 --> 00:00:05,600
Whose life is not a lifetime?

4
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:08,560
Feelings and what to do should not be confused

5
00:00:08,560 --> 00:00:10,480
Sometimes people can't think too carefully

6
00:00:10,480 --> 00:00:13,040
If you think too carefully, you will get into trouble.

7
00:00:13,040 --> 00:00:20,600
It will be very hard to live like this

8
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:22,440
If it's really that free and easy

9
00:00:22,440 --> 00:00:26,850
How could you say this?

10
00:00:26,850 --> 00:00:44,310
It sounds a little sad

11
00:00:44,310 --> 00:00:46,840
No one could escape Yuli’s ice storm

12
00:00:46,840 --> 00:00:49,090
Some people are competing with each other

13
00:00:49,090 --> 00:00:51,690
Lives taken by accidental injury

14
00:00:51,690 --> 00:00:55,020
There are also people who don’t survive the virus attack
